[ti:Afterglow Hotel]
[00:18.80][Verse]
[00:18.88]Ice melting down in a half-empty glass
[00:23.44]Watching the static on a screen from the past
[00:27.72]A cigarette burns to the edge of the tray
[00:32.56]Nothing to feel, nothing to say
[00:37.12]Red heels clicking on the wet avenue
[00:42.44]Vending machine glowing in synthetic blue
[00:46.88]Dialing a number that I already know
[00:50.84]Nowhere to be, nowhere to go
[00:56.48][Pre-Chorus]
[00:56.56]Elevator rising to the top of the haze
[01:01.44]Magnetic keycard in a vertical maze
[01:04.28]I don't need a savior, just a shadow to hold
[01:08.56]Before the night turns cold
[01:12.56]Welcome to the Afterglow Hotel
[01:17.12]Where the neon flickers like a magic spell
[01:21.68]We don't ever sleep, we don't ever wake
[01:26.00]Just riding the frequency, numb to the ache
[01:30.88]Tomorrow is a rumor that we never tell
[01:36.60]Here in the Afterglow Hotel
[02:17.68][Verse]
[02:17.76]Midnight radio whispering lies
[02:22.28]Strangers exchanging those hollowed-out eyes
[02:26.88]Sliding across the back seat of a cab
[02:31.44]Paying the toll, keeping the tab
[02:36.04]Curtains drawn tight against the violet sky
[02:39.72]Watching the sirens go silently by
[02:44.84]I don't need a promise, just a shadow to hold
[02:49.12]Before the night turns cold
[02:53.12]Welcome to the Afterglow Hotel
[02:57.72]Where the neon flickers like a magic spell
[03:02.28]We don't ever sleep, we don't ever wake
[03:06.60]Just riding the frequency, numb to the ache
[03:11.44]Tomorrow is a rumor that we never tell
[03:17.12]Here in the Afterglow Hotel
[03:21.72]Keep the music playing
[03:24.60]Just keep pouring the wine
[03:29.44]The city is rusting, but the lights are fine
[03:35.44]Room three-o-four
[03:36.60]Leave the door unlocked
[03:38.28]Stay a little longer
